      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_20",
      "shape_id": 20,
      "shape_name": "文本框 19",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 68,
      "source_sample_chars": 34,
      "source_text": "项目资源配置存在过度集中或过度分散的现象，导致资源未能得到有效利用。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        63.8,
        191.9,
        267.6,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_21",
      "shape_id": 21,
      "shape_name": "文本框 20",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "精简决策流程：简化内部审批程序，推行电子审批，提高审批速度，减少层级审批。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        63.8,
        335.9,
        297.5,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_22",
      "shape_id": 22,
      "shape_name": "文本框 21",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "精确预算与规划：进行详细的各项预算和资源配置规划，及时调整和优化资源配置。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        63.8,
        407.6,
        240.2,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_23",
      "shape_id": 23,
      "shape_name": "文本框 22",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 86,
      "source_sample_chars": 43,
      "source_text": "缺乏对市场变化的敏感度和创新动力，面对市场竞争时无法灵活调整战略，导致市场适应性较差。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        629.5,
        118.8,
        268.3,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_24",
      "shape_id": 24,
      "shape_name": "文本框 23",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "部分员工缺乏足够的创新意识和能力，执行力低下，导致项目进展缓慢，效果不佳。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        629.5,
        193.1,
        268.3,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_25",
      "shape_id": 25,
      "shape_name": "文本框 24",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 76,
      "source_sample_chars": 38,
      "source_text": "推动内部创新文化：鼓励员工提出创新建议，建立奖励机制，激励员工参与项目创新。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        591.7,
        336.2,
        306.0,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_26",
      "shape_id": 26,
      "shape_name": "文本框 25",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 78,
      "source_sample_chars": 39,
      "source_text": "明确岗位责任：建立清晰的岗位职责体系，明确每个员工的责任和任务，确保责任到人。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        648.8,
        407.6,
        248.9,
        41.9
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_28",
      "shape_id": 28,
      "shape_name": "文本框 27",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 64,
      "source_sample_chars": 32,
      "source_text": "推动跨部门协作：整合多部门资源，避免资源重复投入和资源闲置现象。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        63.8,
